      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Short-range order affects mechanical behavior by modifying interactions between dislocations and local chemical heterogeneities.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Homogenized CrCoNi exhibits predominantly L11-type short-range order.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat treatment can convert or shift the prevailing order from L11 toward L12 order within nanoclusters.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "L11 and L12 short-range orders occur inside nanoclusters in CrCoNi.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "In L11 order, Cr segregates onto alternating close-packed planes.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "L11 ordering creates more obstacles to dislocation motion than L12 ordering.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "L12 ordering minimizes Cr-Cr nearest-neighbor pairs.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Promoting L12 order changes the obstacle landscape encountered by dislocations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat-treatment-induced promotion of L12 order produces a dramatic change in dislocation-slip behavior relative to the homogenized state.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The L12-promoted sample will have a different yield strength from the homogenized L11-predominant baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The L12-promoted sample will have different ductility from the homogenized L11-predominant baseline.",
